{"3999670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Eyes", "steam_appid": 3999670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wanted a monster. Now you have one...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Eyes is a boss battle horror game set in an abandoned water park. You'll face challenging bosses trapped within the park's pool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fish swimming in the undead owner's eyes are the lost souls of children. Free the souls along with your brothers' by defeating all the bosses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get to explore a handcrafted water park that includes several original attractions. When the park was first being built, the owner took great pride in it. After years of decline, the park took on the darkness that fell upon the owner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After sliding down into the park's pool, you will have to defeat bosses to continue closer to releasing your brother's soul. Armed with a revolver; <strong>dodge</strong>, <strong>swim</strong>, and <strong>shoot</strong> to defeat the enemies. Keep your oxygen level from depleting by killing Jellyfish. Some enemies will be your key to survival. Each boss will have it's own set of smaller enemies. Upgrade your character after defeating a boss and discover the dark lore behind Fish Eyes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/400d81504f15fdcda24f23c140f8e91e.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/400d81504f15fdcda24f23c140f8e91e.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/400d81504f15fdcda24f23c140f8e91e.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead owner will offer upgrades to you after defeating bosses. These upgrades make your life much easier, just remember each decision has it's consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE OVERVIEW</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your revolver, fight bosses with each one getting increasingly harder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect oxygen tablets from killing jellyfish </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice souls to upgrade your character </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face smaller enemies while fighting bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lore behind the undead owner </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a hand-crafted water park. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the souls of children by defeating all bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your wristband and go down the WORLD'S LARGEST SLIDE!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/6d8145ff6d0c177ef90b36b87672132c.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wanted a monster. Now you have one...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Eyes is a boss battle horror game set in an abandoned water park. You'll face challenging bosses trapped within the park's pool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fish swimming in the undead owner's eyes are the lost souls of children. Free the souls along with your brothers' by defeating all the bosses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/2ca9f297e38a05f3456a70a5fbec040d.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get to explore a handcrafted water park that includes several original attractions. When the park was first being built, the owner took great pride in it. After years of decline, the park took on the darkness that fell upon the owner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.poster.avif?t=1766159633\" width=900 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.webm?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999670/extras/cfd6ac858cd74dce7b351b7f23eb3cd2.mp4?t=1766159633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After sliding down into the park's pool, you will have to defeat bosses to continue closer to releasing your brother's soul. Armed with a revolver; <strong>dodge</strong>, <strong>swim</strong>, and <strong>shoot</strong> to defeat the enemies. Keep your oxygen level from depleting by killing Jellyfish. Some enemies will be your key to surviva